{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_03A280","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Amanda，你知道怎么去<R=列车车库,TERMINAL>吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=列车车库,TERMINAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":58,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"还记得村子前面那个三岔路口有一辆机车吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":60,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"嗯。在丛林里那个。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"从那里沿着铁轨走，就能到<R=列车车库,TERMINAL>。不过途中有座工厂。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=列车车库,TERMINAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":91,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"伪装成咖啡工厂的那个……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"……毒品提炼工厂。没错。现在被<R=CIA,LA CIA>占据着。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIA,LA CIA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":71,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"穿过那里是最近的路，不过敌人也很多。要绕路的话……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不。既然是近路，正合我意。那座工厂也是他们的据点，有必要摸清情况。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"真让人放心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"工厂的卫兵经常在高处的通道巡逻。要想不被发现，就仔细观察他们的动向。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"或者先<R=狙击,SNIPE>……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=狙击,SNIPE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":34,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"工厂里面也很复杂。别着急，慢慢前进。从后面出去就能到<R=列车车库,TERMINAL>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=列车车库,TERMINAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":106,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"你果然很熟悉啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"你是在讽刺我？KGB还在用那里的时候，我也没怎么……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"不。我只是觉得你很清楚敌人的动向。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"那就好……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":18,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"之后那座<R=列车车库,TERMINAL>的情况，你问过Chico吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=列车车库,TERMINAL>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"他说他们会在那里把货物转装到卡车上。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"也就是说，那似乎是敌人相当重要的据点。别大意。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":69,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"嗯。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":6,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"对了。我还听说，从村子东边有条近路可以直接通往咖啡工厂。具体我也不清楚，需要的话你可以找找看。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":141,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"明白了。我记住了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""}]}